{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249293-favorite-approaches-to-artifact-consumables","id":1249293,"title":"Favorite Approaches to Artifact Consumables","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-28T01:09:32-07:00","id":1249293,"title":"Favorite Approaches to Artifact Consumables","content":"I've been pondering the subject of magical consumables in Exalted, mostly because I have a player who took Craft (Pharmacy) as one of her Abilities. She's not particularly interested in Craft, but if she ever does decide to make something I want to know which approaches work out the best. I looked over some examples from Second and Third Edition and it looks like there's been three different approaches to consumables tried in official material so far.<br /> <br /> The first seems to be Artifacts that require periodic restocking, such as the current version of the Resplendent Satchel of Healing. It's just assumed you have &quot;enough&quot; until something goes wrong. The second is represented by Second Edition Artifacts like the Crucible of Tarim or the Panacea Pipe where the Artifact consumes mundane ingredients to produce a magical consumable. Finally, there are a few Artifacts in Second Edition that are limited use, such as Skin Like Mountains Oil, where the Artifact is used up at some point.<br /> <br /> Has anyone used any of these in game? How'd they work out? Do some approaches not work with Third Edition's somewhat different take on Artifacts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}